    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just about my self-doubt. it's everything. the money, the house, the way I can't even give them a normal life... i'm just dragging them down into the dirt with me. it feels like if i wasn't here, they'd actually have a chance to be happy without constantly worrying about me.",
